  message: Upon the seven seas, Davy Jones discovered an island of gold. He pillaged
    it all and loaded it upon his ship in hopes of infinite riches. However, fate
    had other plans. As his ship sunk beneath the waves in a monsterous storm, his
    gold was never seen again... UNTIL! A single treasure chest washed ashore, and
    now The Great Diving Era has begun.\n\nMeanwhile...
